    "prompt": "Purpose: four project-authored floor-mounted information boards reusing four pinned wall board GLBs with independent original information-content children. Specification: 1.00m x 1.70m x 0.60m bottom-centred envelope, 0.88m x 0.56m content surface at [0,1.3,0.031], blocking footprint half-size [0.5,0.3]. Installation: floor-surface, +Y up, +Z front, identity scale. Support: real six-face solid base and continuous post with structurally distinct bounded support forms. State: empty board defaults, original content visibility only. Source/export: CPU GLTFLoader imports the whole pinned wall frame at +1.3m Y and BoxGeometry adds editable support shapes. GLTFExporter output is read back, geometry checked, and repeated bytes compared. No font rendering, network fetch, physics, or new content assets. Support difference: Cross-shaped horizontal and longitudinal feet with a low horizontal mast brace.",
